Package: cancerRC
Title: Cancer RNA-seq Classifier
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "BIO215",
      family = "Group28 Project Team",
      email = "rakuyonn28@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides documented prediction functions for the BIO215 cancer
    RNA-seq teaching project. The package carries three frozen classifiers:
    a full-matrix multinomial model, a 15-feature panel model, and a
    50-pathway-score model. Each function returns one tumor-class prediction
    per input row.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/rakuyonn28-ux/cancerRC
